# Fixture: two checks that must pass, two that must fail, one plain request.
# Designed outcome for "Run All Checks in File": 2 passed, 2 failed.

### Todo exists
GET {{base_url}}/todos/1
Accept: application/json

expect:
  status: 200
  json_has: ["id", "title"]

### Create a post
POST {{base_url}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "fixture post",
  "userId": 1
}

expect:
  status: 201
  json_has: ["id"]

### Missing todo fails on status
GET {{base_url}}/todos/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

expect:
  status: 200

### Plain text body fails json_has
GET {{base_url}}/plain

expect:
  status: 200
  json_has: ["id"]

### Plain request with no expectations
GET {{base_url}}/todos/1
